; Output: TONE_FILE_COMMAND_LINE.M
; Console: TONE_FILE_COMMAND_LINE.OUT
; Extra input: ext/EXT.FF
; Options: TONE_FILE_COMMAND_LINE.MML EXT
; PMDMML.MAN §2-4, §2-5

#Title TONE_FILE_COMMAND_LINE

; Every voice comes from EXT.FF: naming a voice file on the command line
; implies /V. EXT.FF only defines @0-@2.
A @0 v12 l4 c d e
A @1 v12 l4 e f g
A @2 v12 l4 g a b
; EXT.FF is shorter than the 8KB voice buffer: @5 is not in it.
B @5 v10 l8 c d e f
